---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Kettlebird Creations • Foundation in place"
  description="Astro + React scaffold, Sanity schemas, deployment config, and wireframes for milestone 1."
>
  <section class="paper-shell stack">
    <h2>Foundation snapshot</h2>
    <ul class="checklist">
      <li>✅ Astro 5.x with React islands scaffolded and ready for layouts/components.</li>
      <li>✅ Sanity Studio configured with gallery, comics, writing, merch, and commission schemas.</li>
      <li>✅ Deployment configs for Vercel/Netlify plus environment examples.</li>
      <li>✅ Initial wireframes and content categories captured for design handoff.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>

  <section class="grid">
    <article class="card">
      <h3><span class="badge">Astro</span> Project structure</h3>
      <ul class="checklist">
        <li><strong>Layouts:</strong> Base layout with typography + paper texture baseline.</li>
        <li><strong>Styling:</strong> Global tokens (UPA palette, paper shadows, hand-drawn headers).</li>
        <li><strong>Tooling:</strong> <code>npm run dev</code>, <code>npm run build</code>, <code>npm run check</code>.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <h3><span class="badge">Sanity</span> Schemas</h3>
      <ul class="checklist">
        <li>Gallery items with categories, palette-friendly metadata, alt text.</li>
        <li>Comic series + pages with panel coordinate arrays for guided navigation.</li>
        <li>Written works, products, and commission types with pricing + examples.</li>
        <li>Studio commands: <code>npm install</code>, <code>npm run dev</code>, <code>npm run deploy</code>.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>

    <article class="card">
      <h3><span class="badge">Delivery</span> Deployment</h3>
      <ul class="checklist">
        <li><strong>Vercel:</strong> <code>vercel.json</code> aligned to Astro build output.</li>
        <li><strong>Netlify:</strong> <code>netlify.toml</code> for static publish from <code>dist</code>.</li>
        <li><strong>Env:</strong> <code>.env.example</code> for Sanity project/dataset IDs.</li>
        <li><strong>Docs:</strong> Updated development + Git workflow for branch hygiene.</li>
      </ul>
    </article>
  </section>

  <section class="paper-shell stack">
    <h2>Wireframe snapshots</h2>
    <div class="grid">
      <div>
        <h3>Home / Radial entry</h3>
        <pre class="wireframe">
┌──────────────────────────┐
│  Hero: paper texture     │
│  [Radial menu]           │
│   • Portfolio • Comics   │
│   • Writing  • Shop      │
│   • Commissions • About  │
└──────────────────────────┘
        </pre>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Portfolio grid</h3>
        <pre class="wireframe">
┌───────────────┐
│ Filters: All  │
│  Fanart OC... │
├───────────────┤
│[] [] [] []    │
│[] [] [] []    │
│[] [] [] []    │
│ Lightbox tap  │
└───────────────┘
        </pre>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Comic reader</h3>
        <pre class="wireframe">
┌───────────────┐
│ Page viewport │
│ [Panel guide] │
│ ◀ Prev  Next ▶│
│ Progress 3/12 │
│ Toolbar: zoom │
└───────────────┘
        </pre>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h3>Written works</h3>
        <pre class="wireframe">
┌───────────────┐
│ Cover/Title   │
│ Page flip UI  │
│ 1 2 3 4 5 ... │
│ TOC | Scroll  │
│ Mode toggle   │
└───────────────┘
        </pre>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="paper-shell stack">
    <h2>Next implementation steps</h2>
    <ul class="checklist">
      <li>🎨 Apply hand-drawn textures and SVG filters to hero + cards.</li>
      <li>🖼️ Build gallery grid with PhotoSwipe/React islands.</li>
      <li>📚 Wire Sanity client and seed initial content in Studio.</li>
      <li>🚀 Hook CI/CD to Vercel/Netlify once repository secrets are provided.</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
